    "name": "Velora API - WAMD tests",
    "description": "Run the folders in order (1 -> 5). Set adminEmail / adminPassword in the Variables tab first. Folder 4 (rate limiting) must be last because it locks your IP's login for 15 minutes; restart the backend to reset.",
